BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pickup question: Who's the funniest person in your form at the mom
 ent?
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20270104T151500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20270104T153000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-after-school-questions-secondary-2027-01-04-1@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:ASK: Who's the funniest person in your form at the moment?\n\n
 IF YOU GET A SHRUG: What do they do that's so funny?\n\nTIP: Give them 10 
 to 20 minutes and a snack before asking anything. Many children need time 
 to decompress after school.\n\nSchool day 1 of 60 · Friends and people. O
 n a school holiday or INSET day\, just skip it.\n\nTCH Works · After-Scho
 ol Questions. Everyday conversation ideas\, not professional advice. If yo
 ur child tells you about bullying or harm\, talk to their school. For worr
 ies about a child's safety\, the NSPCC helpline is 0808 800 5000. In an em
 ergency call 999.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.tchworks.co.uk/planners/u/893a07646724cbb9/
