DESCRIPTION:ASK: What's one thing you learned today that you think is actu
 ally useful?\n\nIF YOU GET A SHRUG: Useful for what?\n\nTIP: Side by side 
 beats face to face. Talk tends to flow more easily in the car or on a walk
  than across a table.\n\nSchool day 2 of 60 · Learning. On a school holid
 ay or INSET day\, just skip it.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Questions. Ev
 eryday conversation ideas\, not professional advice. If your child tells y
 ou about bullying or harm\, talk to their school. For worries about a chil
 d's safety\, the NSPCC helpline is 0808 800 5000. In an emergency call 999
 .
