BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pickup question: Best bit and worst bit of today. One word each.
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20270106T151500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20270106T153000
DTSTAMP:20261008T030000Z
UID:tch-after-school-questions-secondary-2027-01-04-3@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:ASK: Best bit and worst bit of today. One word each.\n\nIF YOU
  GET A SHRUG: Want to expand on either?\n\nTIP: Ask one question\, not fiv
 e. Then wait. Count to five in your head before filling the silence.\n\nSc
 hool day 3 of 60 · Feelings. On a school holiday or INSET day\, just skip
  it.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Questions. Everyday conversation ideas\,
  not professional advice. If your child tells you about bullying or harm\,
  talk to their school. For worries about a child's safety\, the NSPCC help
 line is 0808 800 5000. In an emergency call 999.
