UID:tch-after-school-questions-secondary-2027-01-04-5@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:ASK: What's the plan for the weekend?\n\nIF YOU GET A SHRUG: D
 o you need a lift anywhere?\n\nTIP: If you get a one-word answer\, try 'Te
 ll me more about that' rather than a new question.\n\nSchool day 5 of 60 
 · Wrapping up the week. On a school holiday or INSET day\, just skip it.
 \n\nTCH Works · After-School Questions. Everyday conversation ideas\, not
  professional advice. If your child tells you about bullying or harm\, tal
 k to their school. For worries about a child's safety\, the NSPCC helpline
  is 0808 800 5000. In an emergency call 999.
