DESCRIPTION:ASK: Any drama today? You don't have to name names.\n\nIF YOU 
 GET A SHRUG: Whose side are you on?\n\nTIP: Name the feeling before you fi
 x anything: 'That sounds really frustrating.' Advice lands better once the
 y feel heard.\n\nSchool day 6 of 60 · Friends and people. On a school hol
 iday or INSET day\, just skip it.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Questions. 
 Everyday conversation ideas\, not professional advice. If your child tells
  you about bullying or harm\, talk to their school. For worries about a ch
 ild's safety\, the NSPCC helpline is 0808 800 5000. In an emergency call 9
 99.
