UID:tch-after-school-questions-secondary-2027-01-04-7@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:ASK: If you could drop one subject tomorrow\, which would it b
 e? And which would you keep forever?\n\nIF YOU GET A SHRUG: What makes the
  good one good? The subject or the teacher?\n\nTIP: Bedtime is often when 
 the real stuff comes out. If pickup gets a shrug\, try the follow-up at be
 dtime.\n\nSchool day 7 of 60 · Learning. On a school holiday or INSET day
 \, just skip it.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Questions. Everyday conversa
 tion ideas\, not professional advice. If your child tells you about bullyi
 ng or harm\, talk to their school. For worries about a child's safety\, th
 e NSPCC helpline is 0808 800 5000. In an emergency call 999.
