  What would make it a point higher?\n\nTIP: If they tell you something har
 d\, thank them for telling you first. Save any reaction for later.\n\nScho
 ol day 8 of 60 · Feelings. On a school holiday or INSET day\, just skip i
 t.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Questions. Everyday conversation ideas\, n
 ot professional advice. If your child tells you about bullying or harm\, t
 alk to their school. For worries about a child's safety\, the NSPCC helpli
 ne is 0808 800 5000. In an emergency call 999.
