UID:tch-after-school-questions-secondary-2027-01-04-11@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:ASK: Which teacher seems to actually enjoy their job?\n\nIF YO
 U GET A SHRUG: How can you tell?\n\nTIP: Avoid questions with a 'right' an
 swer\, like 'Were you good today?'. They teach children to report\, not to
  talk.\n\nSchool day 11 of 60 · Friends and people. On a school holiday o
 r INSET day\, just skip it.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Questions. Everyd
 ay conversation ideas\, not professional advice. If your child tells you a
 bout bullying or harm\, talk to their school. For worries about a child's 
 safety\, the NSPCC helpline is 0808 800 5000. In an emergency call 999.
