  GET A SHRUG: Did it change your mind about anything?\n\nTIP: Notice the g
 ood. If they tell you about something they did well\, ask how they did it.
 \n\nSchool day 12 of 60 · Learning. On a school holiday or INSET day\, ju
 st skip it.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Questions. Everyday conversation 
