UID:tch-after-school-questions-secondary-2027-01-04-14@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:ASK: What's the best thing you've watched or played this week?
 \n\nIF YOU GET A SHRUG: Should I watch it\, or is it not for me?\n\nTIP: O
 pinions travel better than reports. 'What do you think about...' gets more
  than 'What did you do...'.\n\nSchool day 14 of 60 · Just for fun. On a s
 chool holiday or INSET day\, just skip it.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Qu
 estions. Everyday conversation ideas\, not professional advice. If your ch
 ild tells you about bullying or harm\, talk to their school. For worries a
 bout a child's safety\, the NSPCC helpline is 0808 800 5000. In an emergen
 cy call 999.
