UID:tch-after-school-questions-secondary-2027-01-04-15@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:ASK: Anything next week I need to know about? Money\, forms\, 
 kit\, trips?\n\nIF YOU GET A SHRUG: Let's put it in the calendar now so it
  doesn't get lost.\n\nTIP: Asking about their friends is often easier for 
 teenagers than asking about themselves.\n\nSchool day 15 of 60 · Wrapping
  up the week. On a school holiday or INSET day\, just skip it.\n\nTCH Work
 s · After-School Questions. Everyday conversation ideas\, not professiona
 l advice. If your child tells you about bullying or harm\, talk to their s
 chool. For worries about a child's safety\, the NSPCC helpline is 0808 800
  5000. In an emergency call 999.
