 \nIF YOU GET A SHRUG: Is the group changing much this year?\n\nTIP: Keep y
 our reaction small when they tell you something big. A calm reaction makes
  them more likely to tell you next time.\n\nSchool day 16 of 60 · Friends
  and people. On a school holiday or INSET day\, just skip it.\n\nTCH Works
  · After-School Questions. Everyday conversation ideas\, not professional
  advice. If your child tells you about bullying or harm\, talk to their sc
 hool. For worries about a child's safety\, the NSPCC helpline is 0808 800 
