 of 60 · Learning. On a school holiday or INSET day\, just skip it.\n\nTCH
  Works · After-School Questions. Everyday conversation ideas\, not profes
 sional advice. If your child tells you about bullying or harm\, talk to th
 eir school. For worries about a child's safety\, the NSPCC helpline is 080
 8 800 5000. In an emergency call 999.
