 G: If you were in charge\, how would you fix it?\n\nTIP: A shrug isn't fai
 lure. You're showing you're interested\, every day. That's the point.\n\nS
 chool day 42 of 60 · Learning. On a school holiday or INSET day\, just sk
 ip it.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Questions. Everyday conversation ideas
 \, not professional advice. If your child tells you about bullying or harm
 \, talk to their school. For worries about a child's safety\, the NSPCC he
 lpline is 0808 800 5000. In an emergency call 999.
