UID:tch-after-school-questions-secondary-2027-01-04-48@tchworks.co.uk
DESCRIPTION:ASK: Is anyone giving you a hard time\, at school or online?\n
 \nIF YOU GET A SHRUG: You can always tell me\, and I won't go charging in 
 without talking to you first.\n\nTIP: Keep your reaction small when they t
 ell you something big. A calm reaction makes them more likely to tell you 
 next time.\n\nSchool day 48 of 60 · Feelings. On a school holiday or INSE
 T day\, just skip it.\n\nTCH Works · After-School Questions. Everyday con
 versation ideas\, not professional advice. If your child tells you about b
 ullying or harm\, talk to their school. For worries about a child's safety
 \, the NSPCC helpline is 0808 800 5000. In an emergency call 999.
